Here we will display the alerts generated by the rule engine for a single patient. We will select the first patient ID from the alerts table and print out each alert for that patient, including its severity and message, to illustrate the personalized decision support being delivered.

# Select the first patient in the alerts table to use as an example
example_pid &lt;- alerts$patient_id[1]
cat(sprintf("Alerts for %s:\n", example_pid))

Alerts for P1000:

# Iterate over all alerts for this patient and print each alert's severity and message
for (i in which(alerts$patient_id == example_pid)) {
  cat(sprintf("  [%-8s] %s\n", toupper(alerts$severity[i]), alerts$msg[i]))
}

